---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/content';
import { courseModules } from '../data/course';
const total = courseModules.reduce((sum, module) => sum + module.topics.length, 0);
---
<Layout title="Plan de estudio" active="roadmap">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CISCO NETWORKING ACADEMY · CONCEPTOS BÁSICOS DE REDES V2.0</p><h1>Mi camino en redes</h1><p>17 módulos, una sesión a la vez. Abre un módulo para consultar sus objetivos y empezar tus apuntes.</p></div></div>
  <div id="summary-inbox" class="button-row"></div>
  <section class="progress-panel"><div><h2 id="progress-label">0 de {total} temas</h2><p id="modules-progress">0 de 17 módulos completados</p><p>Tu avance es personal y se guarda en este navegador. No se sincroniza con Cisco.</p></div><strong id="progress-percent">0%</strong><progress id="total-progress" max={total} value="0" aria-labelledby="progress-label"></progress></section>
  <p id="storage-status" class="status-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <noscript><div class="callout">Activa JavaScript para marcar y guardar tu progreso.</div></noscript>
  <div class="course-list">{courseModules.map(module => <details class="stage course-module" data-stage={module.id}><summary><span class="tag">Módulo {module.number}</span><strong>{module.title}</strong><span class="stage-count mono">0 / {module.topics.length}</span></summary><div class="course-body"><p><strong>Objetivo del módulo:</strong> {module.objective}</p><div class="task-list">{module.topics.map(topic => <label class="task-row"><input type="checkbox" data-task={topic.id} /><span><strong>{topic.number} {topic.title}</strong><small>{topic.objective}</small></span></label>)}</div><div class="course-actions"><label class="task-row"><input type="checkbox" data-module-toggle={module.id} /><span>Marcar todo el módulo</span></label><a class="button primary" href={`${withBase('nuevo/')}?modulo=${module.id}`}>Mis apuntes del módulo {module.number}</a></div></div></details>)}</div>
  <p class="example-note">Organizado a partir de tus capturas. Solo módulos y temas de aprendizaje; sin exámenes ni encuestas. Las casillas comienzan vacías para que registres tu propio avance.</p>
  <style>.course-list{display:grid;gap:16px}.course-module summary{cursor:pointer;padding:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:revert}.course-module summary strong{flex:1;min-width:180px}.course-module summary .tag{flex-shrink:0}.course-body{padding:0 24px 24px}.course-body>.task-list{padding:12px 0}.course-actions{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.course-module[open] summary{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:22px}.course-module summary:focus-visible{outline-offset:-4px}.course-module.completed{border-color:#489971}.course-module.completed summary{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#1f9d6726,transparent)}.course-module.completed .stage-count{background:#194932;color:#ceffde;border:1px solid #42805b;padding:.25rem .65rem;border-radius:2rem;font-weight:700}</style>
  <script src="../scripts/roadmap.ts"></script>
</Layout>
